msgstr "Kekunci Leka&t"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:387
msgid "Use &sticky keys"
msgstr "&Gunakan kekunci lekat"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:394
msgid "&Lock sticky keys"
msgstr "Kunci kekunci &lekat"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:401
msgid "Turn sticky keys off when two keys are pressed simultaneously"
msgstr "Matikan kekunci lekat apabila dua kekunci ditekan serentak"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:408
msgid "Use system bell whenever a modifier gets latched, locked or unlocked"
msgstr "G&una loceng sistem apabila pembolehubah diguna, dikunci atau dinyahkunci"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:411
msgid "Locking Keys"
msgstr "Mengunci Kekunci"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:420
msgid "Use system bell whenever a locking key gets activated or deactivated"
msgstr "G&una loceng sistem apabila kekunci mengunci diaktifkan atau dinyahaktifkan"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:423
msgid ""
"Use KDE's system notification mechanism whenever a modifier or locking key "
"changes its state"
msgstr "Guna mekanisma pemberitahuan sistem KDE apabila pengubahsuai atau kekunci pengunci mengubah keadaannya"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:430 kcmaccess.cpp:609
msgid "Configure &Notifications..."
msgstr "Tetapka&n Pemberitahuan..."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:447
msgid "&Modifier Keys"
msgstr "&Kekunci Pengubah"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:455
msgid "Slo&w Keys"
msgstr "Kekun&ci Perlahan"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:464
msgid "&Use slow keys"
msgstr "G&unakan kekunci perlahan"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:474
msgid "Acceptance dela&y:"
msgstr "Kelengahan peneri&maan:"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:481
msgid "&Use system bell whenever a key is pressed"
msgstr "G&una loceng sistem apabila kekunci ditekan"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:488
msgid "&Use system bell whenever a key is accepted"
msgstr "G&una loceng sistem apabila kekunci diterima"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:495
msgid "&Use system bell whenever a key is rejected"
msgstr "G&una loceng sistem apabila kekunci tidak diterima"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:498
msgid "Bounce Keys"
msgstr "Kekunci Lantun"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:507
msgid "Use bou&nce keys"
msgstr "Gu&nakan kekunci lantun"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:517
msgid "D&ebounce time:"
msgstr "M&asa nyahlantun:"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:524
msgid "Use the system bell whenever a key is rejected"
msgstr "Guna loceng sistem apabila kekunci tidak diterima"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:542
msgid "&Keyboard Filters"
msgstr "Tapisan Papan &Kekunci"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:551 kcmaccess.cpp:625
msgid "Activation Gestures"
msgstr "Gerak Isyarat Pengaktifan"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:560
msgid "Use gestures for activating sticky keys and slow keys"
msgstr "Guna gerak isyarat untuk mengaktifkan kekunci lekat dan kekunci perlahan"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:564
msgid ""
"Here you can activate keyboard gestures that turn on the following "
"features: \n"
"Sticky keys: Press Shift key 5 consecutive times\n"
"Slow keys: Hold down Shift for 8 seconds"
msgstr ""
"Di sini anda boleh aktifkan gerak isyarat papan kekunci yang menjalankan "
"ciri yang berikut: \n"
"Kekunci lekit: Tekan kekunci Shift 5 kali berturut-turut\n"
"Kekunci lambat: Tekan kekunci Shift selama 8 saat"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:568
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Here you can activate keyboard gestures that turn on the following "
"features: \n"
"Mouse Keys: %1\n"
"Sticky keys: Press Shift key 5 consecutive times\n"
"Slow keys: Hold down Shift for 8 seconds"
msgstr ""
"Di sini anda boleh aktifkan gerak isyarat papan kekunci yang menjalankan "
"ciri yang berikut: \n"
"Kekunci Tetikus: %1\n"
"Kekunci lekit: Tekan kekunci Shift 5 kali berturut-turut\n"
"Kekunci lambat: Tekan kekunci Shift selama 8 saat"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:573
msgid "Turn sticky keys and slow keys off after a certain period of inactivity."
msgstr ""

#: kcmaccess.cpp:581
msgid " min"
msgstr " min"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:583
msgid "Timeout:"
msgstr "Hadmasa tamat:"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:586
msgid "Notification"
msgstr "Pemberitahuan"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:595
msgid ""
"Use the system bell whenever a gesture is used to turn an accessibility "
"feature on or off"
msgstr ""
"Guna loceng sistem apabila gerak isyarat digunakan untuk menghidupkan atau "
"mematikan ciri kebolehcapaian"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:598
msgid ""
"Show a confirmation dialog whenever a keyboard accessibility feature is "
"turned on or off"
msgstr "Paparkan dialog pengesahan apabila ciri kebolehgunaan papan kekunci dihidupkan atau dimatikan"

#: kcmaccess.cpp:600
msgid ""
"If this option is checked, KDE will show a confirmation dialog whenever a "
"keyboard accessibility feature is turned on or off.\n"
"Ensure you know what you are doing if you uncheck it, as the keyboard "
"accessibility settings will then always be applied without confirmation."
msgstr ""
"Jika pilihan ini ditanda, KDE akan memaparkan dialog pengesahan apabila ciri kebolehcapaian papan kekunci dihidupkan atau dimatikan.\n"
"Pastikan anda mengetahui apa yang anda lakukan jika anda menyahtandakannya, kerana tetapan kebolehcapaian papan kekunci akan sentiasa digunakan tanpa pengesahan."

#: kcmaccess.cpp:602
msgid ""
"Use KDE's system notification mechanism whenever a keyboard accessibility "
"feature is turned on or off"
msgstr ""

